    cutCos ((2 : Cut) * foldPhase) * cutCos ((2 : Cut) * foldPhase) = cpFactorDerived := by
  rw [twoP_eq_quarter, cutCos_quarter_sq, cpFactorDerived_eq_half]

/-! ## §4 — THE ONE REDUCED (1,3) FORM `Q4` threads O4/O5/O7. -/

/-- ★ NEW TIE. The O5 E=mc² invariant on the ℂ-rung-free plane IS the reduced (1,3) form diagonal:
